WEBVTT

00:00:00.703 --> 00:00:03.734
Start with an outline, then add your own perspective.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:09.422
Edit the writing directly. These are your words, not a generated claim.

00:00:09.422 --> 00:00:13.172
Save a draft independently of your shortlist.

00:00:13.172 --> 00:00:17.828
Find it in Your drafts. Reopen it whenever you want to keep writing.

00:00:17.828 --> 00:00:21.844
Export your draft for your publishing workflow. Nothing is posted automatically.
